>MtAw Homebrew:<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1051456-even-more-legacies-updated-to-2e#post1051456\" target=\"_blank\">Even more Legacies, updated to 2E</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1443819-new-2e-legacies-expanded\" target=\"_blank\">New 2E Legacies, expanded</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12619-21c-hermit","name":"21C Hermit","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12619_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3489"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-02-12T19:02:23-08:00","id":1185446,"title":"","content":"<b>Re: The Liberated</b><br /> <br /> I went back and forth on giving <i>Fetter</i> as a free Manifestation. While Fettered a Ephemeral Entity cannot use its Influence or Numina on anything they aren't fettered to.It would almost have to always be paired with Unfetter to have much real use. Since they are Ghosts, having them use their Anchor (which is free just for being a Ghost)felt a bit more elegant.<br /> <br /> As far as using their power on distant devices, I couldn't find any pre-existing teleportation Numina that would quite model what we are looking for. By Default, a Liberated has a +3 equipment modifier Computer, so just about all of them would be pretty competent hackers - more overt supernatural effects would probably come from appropriate influences.I can see them having some unique Numina or Manifestations, but I will need to give that more thought.<br /> <br /> <b>Re:ECL</b><br /> <br /> I see ECL as a group that is just realizing how dark and strange the world truly is. Their next milestone - sleeving the Liberated in new bodies,is still something that is a little ways of for them. But I could easily see other groups becoming very interested in what ECL has to offer.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1420009-the-artificer-s-workshop\" target=\"_blank\">The Artificer's Workshop</a> - A collection of Exalted Artifacts<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/806809-curios-relics-and-tomes\" target=\"_blank\">Curios, Relics, and Tomes</a> - A collection of Relics (Cursed and Otherwise)<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/793173-the-horror-show\" target=\"_blank\">The Horror Lab</a> - A collection of Beasts, Monsters and less definable things.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1128197-strange-places#post1128197\" target=\"_blank\">Strange Places</a> - A collection of Dark, Mysterious, and Wondrous Locations<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/993181-twilight-menagerie\" target=\"_blank\">Twilight Menagerie</a> - A collection of Ephemeral Entities","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/775-reighnhell","name":"Reighnhell","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar775_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"749"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-02-12T19:22:35-08:00","id":1185452,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Reighnhell</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1183958-ghosts-in-the-machine-brain-uploading-and-seed-ai?p=1185446#post1185446\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><b>Re: The Liberated</b><br /> <br /> I went back and forth on giving <i>Fetter</i> as a free Manifestation. While Fettered a Ephemeral Entity cannot use its Influence or Numina on anything they aren't fettered to.It would almost have to always be paired with Unfetter to have much real use. Since they are Ghosts, having them use their Anchor (which is free just for being a Ghost)felt a bit more elegant.<br /> <br /> As far as using their power on distant devices, I couldn't find any pre-existing teleportation Numina that would quite model what we are looking for. By Default, a Liberated has a +3 equipment modifier Computer, so just about all of them would be pretty competent hackers - more overt supernatural effects would probably come from appropriate influences.I can see them having some unique Numina or Manifestations, but I will need to give that more thought.<br /> <br /> <b>Re:ECL</b><br /> <br /> I see ECL as a group that is just realizing how dark and strange the world truly is. Their next milestone - sleeving the Liberated in new bodies,is still something that is a little ways of for them. But I could easily see other groups becoming very interested in what ECL has to offer.</div> </div> </div> </div>Well, since the Liberated primarily function as the AI &quot;core&quot; to a system, I think Fetter would be more of a feature than a bug. Fetter offers longer term viability regarding Essence expenditures, I think.<br /> <br /> Hmm, would calling upon the Liberated for a task count as remembering them for Ghost Essence gain?<br /> <br /> For teleportation, I'm actually thinking a Manifestation might be best - it can play off the Conditions, such that a being can only teleport between Open or Resonant/Anchor/Infrastructure Conditions. It's like Gateway, but within the same &quot;dimension&quot; rather than between them.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malkydel: &quot;And the Machine dictated; let there be adequate illumination.&quot;<br /> Yossarian: &quot;And lo, it was optimal.&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","name":"Vent0","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7212_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5184"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}